{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51488","headline":"春山夜雨 · 李郢","name":"春山夜雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗成数盏兀忘思，瞑目昏昏倒接䍦。\n无鱼无愁且须醉，好风好月更何爲。\n长留酒在花堆雪，不厌身闲鬓聚丝。\n一夕春山到明坐，杜鹃啼歇麑啼时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}